   "Text: delete the quip label at `D.y + 56` and instead draw it as the last line of the right-hand column, after the fault line: `label(ctx, model.quip, rx, ty, {size: 22, font: 'body', color: PALETTE.darkgrey, maxW: D.w - 400})`. The model name label stays at `D.y + 14`. `drawDetail` needs `tr` (pass it from draw). The stats, buttons and hit handling stay exactly as they are.",
